\section*{AEGIS--Continuum Scientific White Paper Suite}
\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{AEGIS--Continuum Scientific White Paper Suite}

\subsection*{Overview}
The AEGIS--Continuum documentation package provides a complete
mathematical, physical, and computational specification of the
continuous spectral-field fusion framework. All documents are written
in formal academic \LaTeX, using theorem--lemma--proof structure,
variational derivations, and explicit tensor-field operators.

This README describes the directory structure, compilation workflow,
and extension guidelines for researchers integrating or reviewing the
AEGIS--Continuum theoretical model.

